{"task": "IG-2B05", "path": "src/wgc/sources/README.md", "start_line": 81, "lines": ["Context boxes may overlap or duplicate geometry; they contribute zero denominator", "units. Every page is present even when it has no regions, and uncovered geometric", "area is reported in integer trillionths as an explicit gap. Complete geometric area", "does not prove substantive inventory: an unprocessed full-page placeholder remains", "unprocessed. IG-2B must replace these placeholders with its independently authored", "regions. The denominator counts regions independently of KB headings; it is not a", "percentage of rule meaning. All 44 official pages are structurally accounted for;", "IG-2A checks extraction/rendering only on pinned pages 1-4.", "", "Transcription, descriptive semantics and formal semantics have separate statuses.", "`represented` forbids gap/reason. `partial`/`unprocessed` require a gap and reason.", "`excluded` requires a reason and an exact source/region/box/level/partition boundary,", "human-role authorization claim and decision artifact. `partition_hash` pins the exact", "source metadata, full registry, sorted page address/geometry bases, all regions' author", "fields (including classification, uncertainty, keys and denominator role), reading order", "and links. Region revisions/coverage and page labels/evidence are excluded to avoid", "circular decision/evidence hashes. A changed author or registry scope invalidates the", "old claim, even with unchanged rectangles. Structural validation of those claims does not", "authenticate a human or grant semantic acceptance; the coordinator must verify them.", "Excluded regions remain visible and never count as represented.", "", "This scope hash is a sidecar author basis, not the frozen IG-1A whole-record region and", "inventory review basis. Each reported exclusion keeps source-IG review freshness", "`unknown` and human authority `unverified`, even when its author scope matches. Later", "reconciliation must est